<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>

</head>

<body>
    <div class="w-full min-h-screen bg-zinc-900 text-white   p-10">
        <div class="w-full flex justify-end">
            <a class="bg-red-500 rounded-md px-3 py-2" href="/logout">logout</a>

        </div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl mb-5 text-white py-2"> <span class="font-light"> Hello</span>, <%= user.name %>
        </h3>
        <h5 class="text-zinc-300  mb-1">you can create a new post.</h5>
        <form action="">
            <textarea placeholder="what's on your mind "
                class="w-1/3 block resize-none p-3 text-white bg-transparent border-2 border-zinc-800 outline-none rounded-md"></textarea>
            <input class="px-3 w-30 text-sm text-white py-2 bg-blue-400 rounded-md block mt-2" type="submit"
                value="Create new post">
        </form>

        <div class="posts mt-10">
            <h3 class="text-zinc-400">your posts. </h3>
            <div class="Postcontainer">
                <div class="post w-1/3 p-5 border-2 border-zinc-500"> 
                <h4>@someusername</h4>
                <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Blanditiis itaque libero sapiente saepe aperiam beatae hic harum, pariatur porro aspernatur quae eos. Obcaecati vitae ex exercitationem iure blanditiis eius consectetur.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
</body>

</html>